<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket standings</p>
<p>after Monday's matches (tabulate under played, won outright, won</p>
<p>on first innings, drawn, lost on first innings, lost outright,</p>
<p>points):</p>
<p> Queensland		2   2   0   0   0   0   12</p>
<p> New South Wales	 2   1   0   0   0   1    6</p>
<p> Tasmania		  2   1   0   0   0   1    6</p>
<p> Victoria		  2   1   0   0   0   1    5.7</p>
<p> Western Australia     1   0   0   0   0   1    0</p>
<p> South Australia	 1   0   0   0   0   1    0</p>
<p>Note: Victoria penalised 0.3 points for slow over rate in</p>
<p>match against New South Wales.</p>
</text>
